We design your website around your goals: who needs to find it, what they should do there, how to measure it.

## Our method

Scoping workshops, mockups, then development in short iterations. Each version is **deployed to a
staging environment** so you can test it.

## What is delivered

- a responsive, accessible and fast website;
- an admin area to edit your content;
- documentation and a half-day training session.
